# Solar AI Eye - Smart Solar Monitoring with ESP32
SIH Viswakarma 2025 | Team Vijayawada | One Repo = Code + Video + Circuit

## Hardware
- ESP32 DevKit V1
- DHT22 -> GPIO 4
- Voltage Sensor (25V) -> GPIO 34
- ACS712 20A -> GPIO 35 (Powered with 3.3V - Safe, No Resistor)
- 16x2 I2C LCD -> SDA 21, SCL 22
- Solar Panel 6V

## Wiring (Safe Mode)
DHT22 VCC->3.3V, GND->GND, DATA->4
Voltage Sensor VCC->5V, GND->GND, S->34
ACS712 VCC->3.3V, GND->GND, OUT->35
LCD VCC->5V, GND->GND, SDA->21, SCL->22

## Fix for White Blocks (Your Video Issue)
1. Breadboard top-bottom red rails connect with wire, blue rails connect with wire
2. Adjust blue pot behind LCD
3. Change 0x3F to 0x27 if still blocks

## How to Run
Baud 115200, Libraries: DHT, Adafruit Unified, LiquidCrystal_I2C

